# Session 13 Assignments – Advanced Frontend Projects

##  Overview
This session focuses on **advanced frontend web development** using **HTML5** and **CSS3**, with multiple hands-on mini projects that improve UI design, page navigation, layouts, and asset management.

The assignments include single-page layouts, multi-page city websites, styling practice, component design, and real-world webpage structuring.

---

##  Topics Covered
- HTML5 Structure
- CSS3 Styling
- Multi-page Website Development
- Navigation Design
- Image Assets Management
- Layout Design
- Responsive UI Concepts
- Component Styling
- Portfolio-style Pages
- Real-world Frontend Development

---

