##  How to Run

Clone repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/NITESHSA1/ATP_24EG106A21.git
```

Move into folder:

```bash
cd session13_assignments
```

Open any project:

```bash
index.html
```

Or use:

```bash
Live Server Extension
```

for real-time preview.

